<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Heidemij unit wins Malaysia order.</title>
<headline>Dutch Heidemij unit wins Malaysia order.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grabowski &amp; Poort, a unit of Dutch engineering consultancy company Heidemij has won an order worth 10 million guilders from Malaysia, Heidemij said in a statement.</p>
<p>The total project, involving land reclamation and resort development in Mersing, part of Johore in Malaysia, is worth some 200 million guilders.</p>
<p>G&amp;P will carry out a report into the environmental effects of the development.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
